                <Path Data="M19,3H14.82C14.4,1.84 13.3,1 12,1C10.7,1 9.6,1.84 9.18,3H5C3.9,3 3,3.9 3,5V19C3,20.1 3.9,21 5,21H19C20.1,21 21,20.1 21,19V5C21,3.9 20.1,3 19,3M12,3C12.55,3 13,3.45 13,4C13,4.55 12.55,5 12,5C11.45,5 11,4.55 11,4C11,3.45 11.45,3 12,3M19,19H5V5H7V7H17V5H19V19Z"
